930 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Yingge Soul is rooted in the Chaoshan region\054 drawing spiritual nourishment from the national intangible cultural heritage of Yingge dance\056 We transform the dancers\047 dashing figures wielding mallets and the rich patterns of traditional costumes into a cultural expression within our tea\056 Here\054 Yingge dance is not only an ancient folk art\054 but also the \042heroic spirit\042 flowing in the brand\047s veins\024vigorous yet heartwarming\056 Yingge Soul uses tea as a medium to bring intangible cultural heritage into everyday life\054 allowing every drinker to feel the power of inheritance and the pulse of youth in the aroma of tea\056)
     /K [ 128 ]
     /P 931 0 R
     /Pg 674 0 R
